        "label": "Excellent",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "This was our second stay at this property as a family because we enjoyed this property so much during our first visit! It was clean with comfortable beds and spacious bedrooms. The family / activity room off the large kitchen and dining area was perfect for watching movies, playing board games, doing puzzles or just hanging out and reading. We brought our mini Golden Doodle, so the property was very pet friendly and allowed for easy walks outside and enjoyed the golf cart to drive to locations along 30a and to downtown Seaside. Overall, an excellent experience all around and we will likely be back!",
